4° ("Gourmet Guild")= {{The Gourmet Guild is a guild made up of Pecorine, who is a 17-year-old red-haired girl with light blue eyes who is very lively, upbeat, and protective of her allies. Pecorine is the guild leader, She loves to cook and eat, she has a very big appetite and she has a sweet tooth.}}

